# Supabase configuration for real-time "My View" commentary.
# When configured, H.E. Zeenat Kureshi / Office can publish views on live news articles
# which are stored in your Supabase PostgreSQL database and broadcast in real-time.
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL script from supabase/migrations/001_views.sql in Supabase SQL Editor
# 3. Copy Project URL and Anon/Publishable API Key here:
#
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-supabase-anon-publishable-key

# Where enquiry forms are delivered (Invest / Collaborate / Media pop-ups, plus the
# Contact, Trade, Media and Women Cell page forms).
#
# Until this is set the forms do NOT send anything by themselves: pressing submit
# opens the visitor's own email app with the details pre-filled, and the form says so.
# Set it to any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST -- Formspree, Web3Forms, a Supabase
# Edge Function, or your own API. Success is only shown when the server answers OK;
# if it fails, the visitor falls back to the pre-filled email.
#
#   Formspree : VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/yourFormId
#   Web3Forms : VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
#               VITE_ENQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key
#
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ACCESS_KEY=
